+# OB-093 / OB-040 / OB-041 / OB-042：首发平台隔离、结构化进程执行、容器沙箱与进程树回收 / First-Platform Isolation, Process Execution, Container Sandbox, and Process-Tree Supervision
+
+## 中文说明
+
+状态：IN_PROGRESS。首测 Darwin arm64；Docker Desktop client/server 29.1.3、引擎 linux arm64。初测 socket 缺失是历史观察，后续后端已可连接；未由本轮启动用户服务或切换默认 context。
+
+已测原语：`tests/components/native_poc/test_profile_lock.py` 在两个真实 Python 进程间验证 flock 的第二实例拒绝、客户端结束不释放 supervisor 锁、owner 强杀后释放。该测试不等于完整 Supervisor / daemon 交接、任意子孙回收、logout / sleep / Job / 容器资格。
+
+实际命令：`OPENBOT_NATIVE_TESTS=1 PYTHONPATH=services/core/src .venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/components/native_poc/test_docker.py -q --tb=short`。本次 8 passed；日志在 evidence/implementation/native-container-tests.log，实际容器 ID、客户端 PID、stop/wait/export/remove 次序及空残留列表在 native-container.json。测试使用独立空 Docker config，只运行准备阶段固定的官方 Alpine digest、--pull=never，不使用本机企业镜像或个人 registry 登录。
+
+| 能力 | 当前证据 | 限制 |
+|---|---|---|
+| 容器隔离 | 非 root、只读输入和根层、cap-drop/no-new-privileges、无 HOME/凭据/socket、无路由和 eth0 | 不是整个 macOS/VM 出口审计 |
+| 配额 | cgroup 内存/PID 读回；实际 OOM exit 137；fork 被 PID 上限拒绝；CPU 配置读回 | CPU 压力和磁盘配额未实测 |
+| 独立生命周期 | 杀死 Docker attach 客户端，容器仍 Running；随后按登记 ID stop/wait | 不能把客户端退出当回收 |
+| 导出与回收 | 停止后有界 tar 字节验证，拒绝路径穿越/链接/超限，再 remove；4 个登记容器均回收 | 仅合成 receipt，完整 Artifact Broker 待 OB-036/041 |
+| 其他平台 | Windows x64 / Linux x64 NOT_RUN | Docker Desktop Linux VM 不算原生 Linux 资格 |
+
+内存夹具首版未制造足够实际分配，测试失败并清理；改为动态增长至 128 MiB 后实际触发 64 MiB 上限，没有把未触发压力当作通过。
+
+仍需实现并验证：唯一 supervisor 的父子锁协议、daemon 独立启动拒绝、多代子孙/逃逸/父进程强杀与旧 epoch 接管、登记域无法核对时阻止 dispatch。正式 native/supervisor 与 python-on-whales 尚未实现/安装，不是“缺 Docker 环境”；这些是 OB-093/015/040—042 的工程待办。镜像仅为本地测试资产，完整镜像许可与发行供应链资格仍 NOT_RUN。任何失败都不得降级宿主执行。
+
+实现（OB-040）：新增 `contracts/schemas/dispatch.schema.json` 与 `services/core/src/openbot/tools/executors/process.py`（`ControlledProcessExecutor`、`ProcessExecutionPlan`、`ProcessResourceLimits`、`ProcessExecutionResult`、`classify_command_security`）：
+1. 锁定不可变执行计划与禁止裸 Shell：锁定 `executable`、`argv`、`workspace_snapshot_digest`、`execution_backend`（仅允许 `ISOLATED_CONTAINER`/`ISOLATED_WORKER`，拒绝宿主后端）、固定 `sha256:...` `image_digest`、`network_mode`、干净 `isolated_home`/`isolated_tmpdir`、最小 `env` 与资源限制；硬拒绝 `sh -c`/`bash -c`/`cmd /c` 等 Shell 包装与 `--pre` 隐藏预处理器；`pytest`、`python`、`npm`、`git` 等一律归类为 `CODE_EXECUTION`，绝不因动作名叫 `search`、`snapshot` 或 `lint` 而放行未隔离执行。
+2. 无隔离后端拒绝降级宿主与双受管标识映射：当 `isolation_backend_qualified=False` 时立即抛出 `PermissionError`（绝不自动回退宿主 Shell）；结果同时记录 `client_pid` 与 `container_id`，若客户端退出或超时但 `container_confirmed_stopped=False`，严格映射为 `UNKNOWN`（停止客户端不自动认定容器已停止）；输出经 `RedactionPipeline` 流式脱敏并受 `max_output_bytes` 截断保护。
+
+实现（OB-041）：新增 `services/core/src/openbot/tools/executors/sandbox.py`（`ContainerSandboxBroker`、`ContainerOwnership`、`validate_and_extract_tar_export`）与 `native/supervisor/src/worker_control.rs`：
+1. 固定隔离参数与拒绝自动兜底：强制 `--pull=never`、`--network=none`、`--read-only`、`--cap-drop=ALL`、`--security-opt=no-new-privileges`、`--user=65532:65532`（非 root）、`--memory`、`--cpus`、`--pids-limit`、只读 `/input` 与独立 `/out`，绝不使用 `--rm` 自动删除证据；拒绝挂载 `docker.sock` 或宿主 `HOME`；未认证后端（如 `podman`、`nerdctl`、`bubblewrap` 或宿主）立即返回 `CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE`，绝不自动降级兜底。
+2. 独立归属登记与 `stop -> wait -> export_verified -> remove` 严格时序：创建前登记 `openbot.profile_id`/`operation_id`/`attempt_id`/`runtime_epoch` 标签；客户端进程退出（`notify_client_exited`）绝不将容器标为已回收；导出前强制要求容器已 `stop` 且 `wait` 确认完成，经 `validate_and_extract_tar_export` 拒绝符号链接、硬链接、设备文件、路径穿越（`..` 或 `/`）、可执行权限位（`0o111`）及超限归档后，才允许 `remove` 本 profile 登记的容器（拒绝触碰未登记用户容器）。
+
+实现（OB-042）：新增 `services/core/src/openbot/tools/executors/supervision_port.py`（`ProcessSupervisorService`、`PLATFORM_CAPABILITY_BOUNDARIES`、`validate_windows_job_spawn_order`）与 `native/supervisor/src/process_tree.rs` 及 `tests/integration/platform/test_process_tree_supervision.py`：
+1. 平台监督边界与拒绝已归档 crate：显式记录 Darwin（POSIX 进程组 + 容器 ID）、Linux（cgroup v2 / 进程组 + `PR_SET_PDEATHSIG`）与 Windows（`CreateProcessW(CREATE_SUSPENDED) -> AssignProcessToJobObject(KILL_ON_JOB_CLOSE) -> ResumeThread`，入 Job 失败必须在恢复前终止进程）的边界；明确声明 `command-group` 已拒绝引入，且 `Drop`/pipe EOF 仅作协作机制（`cooperative_eof_or_drop_is_100_percent=False`）。
+2. 真实 POSIX 进程组回收、防 PID 复用误杀与逃逸 Quarantine：实测真实子进程派生孙进程后的 `SIGTERM -> SIGKILL` 进程组回收与 macOS 僵尸进程 `waitpid(WNOHANG)` 收割；发送信号前核验登记身份与 `process_start_token`（检测 PID 复用并拒绝误杀无关进程）；若存在逃逸子孙进程或容器未确认回收，`old_domain_isolated=False`、`quarantine_required=True`、`new_dispatch_allowed=False`；UI 窗口关闭（`on_ui_window_closed`）绝不停止常驻 daemon 或在途 worker。
+
+影响：OB-029 正式隔离执行门禁尚未通过；原生进程/后端组合需完成上述缺口。存储、合同与 SDK 故障验证可继续，不以该门禁代替全部 M1 工作。
+
+## English Summary
+
+- **OB-093 (`IN_PROGRESS`)**: Darwin arm64 `flock` single-instance probe (`tests/components/native_poc/test_profile_lock.py`) and native Docker Desktop 29.1.3 isolation PoC (`tests/components/native_poc/test_docker.py`, 8 passed in `evidence/implementation/native-container-tests.log`: non-root, read-only rootfs/input, cap-drop, `--network=none`, OOM exit 137 at 64 MiB limit, PID limit enforcement, independent container lifecycle after client kill, and bounded tar export).
+- **OB-040 (`IN_PROGRESS`)**: Structured process execution protocol (`contracts/schemas/dispatch.schema.json`, `services/core/src/openbot/tools/executors/process.py`, and `tests/unit/test_process_executor.py`, 2 passed):
+  1. `ProcessExecutionPlan` & `classify_command_security`: Locks `executable`, `argv`, `workspace_snapshot_digest`, `execution_backend`, pinned `image_digest`, `isolated_home`/`isolated_tmpdir`, `env`, and `ProcessResourceLimits`; rejects raw shell wrappers (`sh -c`, `bash -c`, `cmd /c`) and `--pre` flags; classifies `pytest`, `python`, `npm`, and `git` as `CODE_EXECUTION` regardless of action label (`search`/`snapshot`/`lint`).
+  2. `ControlledProcessExecutor`: Refuses execution when `isolation_backend_qualified=False` (zero host fallback); tracks `client_pid` and `container_id` separately so `container_confirmed_stopped=False` maps to `UNKNOWN`; enforces `max_output_bytes` and `RedactionPipeline` on `stdout`/`stderr`.
+- **OB-041 (`IN_PROGRESS`)**: Worker container sandbox broker and resource limits (`services/core/src/openbot/tools/executors/sandbox.py`, `native/supervisor/src/worker_control.rs`, and `tests/unit/test_container_sandbox.py`, 3 passed):
+  1. `ContainerSandboxBroker`: Enforces non-root (`65532:65532`), `--cap-drop=ALL`, `--security-opt=no-new-privileges`, `--read-only`, `--network=none`, `--pull=never`, memory/CPU/PID limits, and read-only `/input` without `--rm`; blocks `docker.sock` and host `HOME` mounts; fails closed with `CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE` for unqualified or unapproved backends (`podman`, `nerdctl`, `bubblewrap`, `host`).
+  2. Independent lifecycle & `validate_and_extract_tar_export`: Tracks `ContainerOwnership` labels (`profile_id`, `operation_id`, `attempt_id`, `runtime_epoch`), never treats CLI client exit as container reclamation, enforces `stop -> wait -> export_verified -> remove` order, rejects symlinks/traversal/executable bits in exported tar streams, and refuses to remove unregistered user containers.
+- **OB-042 (`IN_PROGRESS`)**: Worker process-tree cancellation and reclamation (`services/core/src/openbot/tools/executors/supervision_port.py`, `native/supervisor/src/process_tree.rs`, and `tests/integration/platform/test_process_tree_supervision.py`, 2 passed):
+  1. `PLATFORM_CAPABILITY_BOUNDARIES` & `validate_windows_job_spawn_order`: Documents Darwin/Linux/Windows supervision limits (`cooperative_eof_or_drop_is_100_percent=False`, `command-group` rejected, Windows `CREATE_SUSPENDED -> AssignProcessToJobObject -> ResumeThread` with pre-resume termination on failure).
+  2. `ProcessSupervisorService`: Verifies real POSIX process-group + grandchild termination (`SIGTERM -> SIGKILL` with `waitpid(WNOHANG)` zombie reaping), enforces `process_start_token` checks against PID reuse, sets `old_domain_isolated=False` and `quarantine_required=True` when residual PIDs or unstopped containers remain, and preserves daemon/workers when UI windows close.
